3	 * updates preserve human ownership through `mergeEntityFields`; held creates,
4	 * deletes, and merges use their normal mutation paths after approval. Every
5	 * proposal is a pending internal run plus an approval event, so delivery and
6	 * decisions remain durable across replicas. Claim/approve/reject orchestration
7	 * lives in manage_operations next to `supersedeActionEvent`.
